{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06996","headline":"望太华赠卢司仓 · 陶翰","name":"望太华赠卢司仓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行吏到西华，乃观三峯壮。\n削成元气中，杰出天河上。\n如有飞动色，不知青冥状。\n巨灵安在哉，厥迹犹可望。\n方此顾行旅，末由饬仙装。\n葱茏记星坛，明灭数云嶂。\n良友垂真契，宿心所微尚。\n敢投归山吟，霞径一相访。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}